{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>佳存成人鈣片60粒裝（Caltrate Adult）邊度買平？新假期整理屈臣氏、萬寧及龍豐共3間零售商的網店報價。以同款單盒標價計，最低與次低相差HK$77.9，約34%。</p>\n<h2>佳存成人鈣片60粒裝各網店報價</h2>\n<table>\n<thead></thead>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th><strong>零售商</strong></th>\n<th><strong>單盒標價</strong></th>\n<th><strong>單盒總額</strong></th>\n<th><strong>計價條件</strong></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>最低已核實｜龍豐</strong></td>\n<td><strong>HK$152</strong></td>\n<td><strong>HK$152</strong></td>\n<td><strong>單盒標價</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>屈臣氏</td>\n<td>HK$229.9</td>\n<td>HK$229.9</td>\n<td>單盒標價</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>萬寧</td>\n<td>HK$229.9</td>\n<td>HK$229.9</td>\n<td>單盒標價</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2>佳存成人鈣片60粒裝單盒價錢點計？</h2>\n<p>買一盒，龍豐的同款網上標價為HK$152，較表列次低標價HK$229.9少HK$77.9。這個價差以單盒比較。</p>\n<p>以上為2026年11月11日商戶網上報價，未計運費，價格、優惠及供應以商戶為準。網店來源：<a href=\"https://www.watsons.com.hk/zh-hk/%E4%BD%B3%E5%AD%98-%E4%BD%B3%E5%AD%98%E6%88%90%E4%BA%BA%E9%88%A3%E7%89%87-60%E7%B2%92%E8%A3%9D/p/BP_821427\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">屈臣氏</a><a href=\"https://www.mannings.com.hk/zh-hant/caltrate-adult-60pcs/p/304451\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">萬寧</a><a href=\"https://eshop.lungfung.hk/product/mdn250311/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">龍豐</a></p>\n<p>佳存成人鈣片含鈣及維他命D3。鈣是骨骼和牙齒的重要成分，維他命D有助身體吸收鈣。如對成分或服用有疑問，建議先諮詢醫生或其他合資格的醫護專業人士。<a href=\"https://ods.od.nih.gov/factsheets/Calcium-Consumer/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">美國國立衞生研究院鈣質資料</a></p>\n<p>計算方法：（較高標價－較低標價）÷較高標價×100%。本次以（HK$229.9－HK$152）÷HK$229.9×100%計，約34%。上述比例未計運費及額外活動，亦不代表全港最低價、歷史低價或不同包裝版本的配方已完全核實一致。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179433716968884649_17645836776af3699255b51.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"佳存成人鈣片60粒裝格價：龍豐 HK$152；單盒按同數量基準比較約平34%\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179433716968884649_17645836776af3699255b51.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a></p>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>點樣先可以用圖中價格買到佳存成人鈣片60粒裝？<i></i></p>\n<p>以2026年11月11日網上報價，龍豐的單盒商品總額為HK$152。條件為單盒標價，未計運費。</p>\n<p>今次格價比較哪一款包裝？<i></i></p>\n<p>今次是粉紅色盒的佳存成人鈣片60粒裝。佳存成人50+配方另有獨立包裝。</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T19:26:02.468273+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":655,"images":1,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T18:59:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T20:20:25.558954+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T19:19:34.895677+00:00","content_hash":"8e3d8585189f999a85c36e1b2163bc25b29e337db9cf679c66794077094ffd41","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}